  "tandemSoGehts": [
    "Cut the cards in the middle. Partner A takes the left half, Partner B the right half.",
    "A builds question 1 from the tiles and reads it out: “¿Dónde pone Lucía la botella?”",
    "B only has tiles: the verb in its base form and the parts of the sentence. Build the answer and put the verb in the right form (pone, está, están). Watch the point: with ir and llevar choose a, with poner, meter, colgar, dejar choose en. A choice tile looks like “a / en”: keep only the right one.",
    "Then B asks question 2 and A answers. Take turns. At the end, check with the answer sheet.",
    "Now swap cards and do it all again, faster."
  ],
